ComfyUI-KJNodes 195d312 (https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes): the VRGDG H3 lab's local fixes, as Legion's
sv-comfy runs them (read 2026-10-10 from its profile/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-KJNodes with git diff).

- nodes/minimax_nodes.py (new) and its registration in __init__.py: "MiniMax H3 Chunk FeedForward" and "MiniMax H3
  Low VRAM Attention", which cut H3's peak VRAM.
- nodes/model_optimization_nodes.py: SageAttention falls back to PyTorch attention for head sizes it can't do
  (SageAttention3 at head_dim >= 256, or an "Unsupported head_dim" error) instead of failing the run.

This patch modifies a GPL-3.0 project and is under the GPL-3.0 like it. The Dockerfile applies it with `git apply`,
which skips this header.

